OL,3,ABurnham not doing enough to boost
OL,4,Agrowth, says former business secretary
OL,5,
OL,6,FA cabinet minister under Sir Keir
OL,7,FStarmer has said Andy Burnham's
OL,8,Fgovernment is not focused enough on
OL,9,Fboosting economic growth and needs to
OL,10,Fact with "more urgency".
OL,12,FSpeaking to the BBC two months after
OL,13,Fbeing sacked in Burnham's cabinet
OL,14,Freshuffle upon entering office, Peter
OL,15,FKyle said he wasn't making a
OL,16,F"criticism" but "pointing to the
OL,17,Fpotential that we have as a country and
OL,18,Fas a government".
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
