OL,3,AAt least two dead after explosion
OL,4,Adestroys building close to Acropolis in
OL,5,AAthens
OL,6,
OL,7,FAn American man and woman have died,
OL,8,Fwith two more US tourists missing, AFP
OL,9,Fnews agency reported citing local
OL,10,Fofficials. A Greek national and UK
OL,11,Fnational who lived in the building are
OL,12,Falso said to be missing.
OL,14,FPictures from the scene showed
OL,15,Femergency service workers searching
OL,16,Fthrough rubble, with a gas leak the
OL,17,Fsuspected cause of the blast.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
